{% extends 'base.twig' %}
{% block content %}
<section class="container page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR CHOICE</p><h1>Privacy & analytics</h1><p>Clear information. Optional measurement. You stay in control.</p></section>
<article class="container privacy-content">
<h2>Optional website analytics</h2><p>With your permission, this website uses Google Analytics 4 to understand visits to public documentation and improve its content. Google receives page addresses without query strings, page titles, referring website origins, and browser and device information. Analytics cookies provide a pseudonymous visitor identifier. Google also processes network information to deliver its service.</p>
<p>Google Analytics is not loaded before you allow it. We do not send account identifiers, email addresses, search terms, form values, or private account and administrator pages to Analytics. Advertising personalization, Google signals, and enhanced measurement are disabled.</p>
<h2>Change your choice</h2><p>Use “Analytics preferences” in the footer to allow or reject analytics at any time. Rejecting stops our measurement and removes this site's Google Analytics cookies. Your choice is stored in your browser. Global Privacy Control and Do Not Track are respected.</p>
<h2>Essential website data</h2><p>Account sessions, security controls, and the services you explicitly request work independently of optional analytics. The server processes requests and security logs to operate and protect the website. Browser preferences such as language, theme, and analytics choice stay on your device.</p>
<h2>Questions</h2><p><a href="mailto:noreply@elangphp.com">noreply@elangphp.com</a></p><p><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy ↗</a></p>
</article>
{% endblock %}
